{"id": "85910", "name": "אינטגרציה בחלקים – a·x·e^(bx) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Find the integral:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,dx = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Integration by parts</b><br><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">Integration by parts: \\( \\int u\\,v'\\,dx=uv-\\int u'\\,v\\,dx \\)</div>Below is the formula for integration by parts. From the product rule for differentiating \\(u\\left(x\\right)v\\left(x\\right)\\) we can derive the rule for integration by parts, namely:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int u\\left(x\\right)v'\\left(x\\right)\\, dx= u\\left(x\\right)v\\left(x\\right)- \\int u'\\left(x\\right)v\\left(x\\right)\\, dx. \\]</p>We set \\(u\\left(x\\right)={{CT:1}}\\) and \\(v'\\left(x\\right)={{CT:2}}\\), so \\(u'\\left(x\\right)={{CT:3}}\\) and \\(v\\left(x\\right)={{CT:4}}\\). Then<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:0}}\\,dx&= {{CT:5}}-\\int {{CT:6}} \\,dx, \\\\ &= {{CT:5}}-\\frac{{CT:7}}{{CT:8}}+c. \\end{aligned} \\]</p>Where \\(c\\) is an integral constant.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "int", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "answer", "testoptions": "x", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "INT-PRT-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "INT-PRT-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "uv+u_dashedv/b+c", "testoptions": "x", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "WRONG_FORMULA", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>You appear to have used the formula \\[\\int u\\left(x\\right)v'\\left(x\\right)\\, dx= u\\left(x\\right)v\\left(x\\right)+ \\int u'\\left(x\\right)v\\left(x\\right)\\, dx,\\]</p> <p>which is not the correct formula for integration by parts.</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "INT-PRT-1-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "answer", "av_dashed", "b", "b_squared", "f", "u", "u_dashed", "u_dashedv", "uv", "v", "v_dashed"], "nvariants": 50}